# Harness State (API)

- `feature_list.json` — scope per feature; do not mark done without verify evidence
- `progress.md` — handoff for the next session
- When a public command advances phase, record: command, files changed, verify run/not run, remaining blockers

Examples: `.harness/progress.example.md`, `.harness/feature_list.example.json`
